Key improvements made:
1. Added docstrings with emojis for all functions
2. Improved code organization and modularity
3. Added Streamlit integration
4. Added restart functionality after game ends
5. Better variable naming and comments
6. Added proper error handling
7. Created a comprehensive README.md
8. Added type hints (consider adding more)
9. Improved the winner display function
10. Added proper game exit handling

To deploy this with Streamlit:
1. Save the code as `connect_four.py`
2. Install requirements: `pip install numpy pygame streamlit`
3. Run: `streamlit run connect_four.py`

The game will be available in your browser at `http://localhost:8501`